  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-91\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 91</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <div class=\"article-text\">\n      <p>La demande d'un octroi de subvention en cas de modification de l'organisateur est introduit à l'aide du formulaire de demande de <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2021-03-12/10\" data-law-type=\"AGF\" data-article-number=\"196\">l'agence</span> comprenant les données, visées à l'article 79,</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">1°</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">2°</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">3°</span>\n          <ol>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"a)\"><span class=\"provision-text\">a)</span></li>\n            <li class=\"sub-provision\" data-marker=\"b)\"><span class=\"provision-text\">b)</span></li>\n          </ol>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">4°</span></li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">5°</span></li>\n      </ol>\n      <p>, et une déclaration sur l'honneur sur le respect des conditions, visées à l'article 90.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
